 **********************************************
 ********* Roland GP-16 Patch Chart ***********
 **********************************************
 
 Patch Name: Pickin' Luxery
     Author: Jonas Nordin
   Comments: Made for slow picking, like cavatina.
 
 PROGRAM CHANGE NO. B: 22
 
 SEQUENCE BLOCK A	123456
 SEQUENCE BLOCK B	123456
 
 BLOCK A - ON/OFF       ****5*
 BLOCK B - ON/OFF       *2**5*
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-5 PARAMETRIC EQ
 
    HI FREQ 8.0 kHz
   HI LEVEL +12.0 dB
 
   H.M.FREQ 4.0 kHz
     H.M. Q 4.1
 H.M. LEVEL +2.0 dB
 
  L.M. FREQ 392 Hz
     L.M. Q 1.6
 L.M. LEVEL +1.5 dB
 
    LO FREQ 60 Hz
   LO LEVEL +4.5 dB
 
  OUT LEVEL -3.0 dB
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-2 
 	a. CHORUS
 
 P. DELAY 0 msec
     RATE 6
    DEPTH 75
 E. LEVEL 90
 
 ----------------------------------
 B-5 REVERB
 
 DECAY 4.0 sec
 
      MODE: HALL 1

    CUTOFF 4.46 kHz
 PRE DELAY 72 msec
  E. LEVEL 40
 
 ----------------------------------
 MASTER VOLUME 100
 
 ----------------------------------
 EXPRESSION PEDAL
 
 ASSIGN OFF

 ----------------------------------
 OUTPUT SELECT
 
 CHANNEL  1

